    editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - guid: 9253e52e-317c-4116-82d2-4ca929606bd5
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Get this, I walked past the seaweed noodle forge the other day. Seaweed noodle sweatshop, more like.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: ab7b51cc-be17-45db-b14e-9e5839ff5268
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Anyhow, I was walking, lost in thought, and when I got to the entrance, I instinctively turned in.
      delaySeconds: 4.6
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: 98fef47f-7f71-43cc-a9b6-6776655b276b
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Reached for the door terminal and everything.
      delaySeconds: 4.5
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 54a4049f-6fd4-4581-bf98-b84406b19a58
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I was dumbfounded in front of that door. It was the strangest feeling.
      delaySeconds: 2.6
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: 5abcafc5-c735-4958-9fbe-1b1788208dbc
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: The smell of seaweed... It was familiar. Like it was always there, enveloping me.
      delaySeconds: 3.5
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: 844f65b7-8418-4289-bcf8-28f5a302711d
    kind: 4
    line:
      text: 
      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
